#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 190, 155, 78
#: 0x1fa3cfc
msgctxt "hash:45733a46"
msgid "hash:45733a46"
msgstr ""
"Маленькому мальчику снится кошмар!\\nПоговорить с отцом мальчика\\nв "
"городке Тармиган."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 190, 177, 155
#: 0x1fa3d4b
msgctxt "hash:a781d810"
msgid "hash:a781d810"
msgstr ""
"Маленькому мальчику снится кошмар!\\nСесть на лодку до острова Фуллмун\\n"
"и добыть Лунное перо."

# source: Use городок with masculine agreement and reviewed inflections for references to the ten selected Town locations.
# source: Use деревня for Village.
# source: Use город for City.
# source: Preserve proper names, lowercase running-text descriptors and unrelated grammatical referents.
# source: status: unreviewed
